#: apprise_api/api/templates/welcome.html:12
msgid ""
"\n"
"      <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://github.com/caronc/apprise\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Apprise</a> allows you to send a notification to almost\n"
"      all of the most popular notification services available to us today such as: <em>Telegram</em>, <em>Discord</em>,\n"
"      <em>Slack</em>, <em>Amazon SNS</em>, <em>Gotify</em>, etc.\n"
"      This API provides a simple gateway to directly access it via an HTTP interface."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://github.com/caronc/apprise\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Apprise</a> te permite enviar una notificación a casi todos los servicios de notificación más populares disponibles hoy en día, tales como: <em>Telegram</em>, <em>Discord</em>, <em>Slack</em>, <em>Amazon SNS</em>, <em>Gotify</em>, etc. Esta API proporciona una puerta de enlace sencilla para acceder directamente a ella a través de una interfaz HTTP."

